	"name": "Marshal's Pennant",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-symbol-sun-gold-red.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Bearing the symbol of an army from an earlier age, this banner glows subtly in darkness. This banner has 5 charges. By expending a charge after you’ve used your reaction but before the start of your next turn, you may take another reaction. When found, this banner has [[/r 1d4]] charges, and recovers 1 charge at the end of a long rest. If you expend the last charge, roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1, the banner loses its power.</p><p>In the hands of a Marshal, this banner increases the radius of their @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.d71mc2057x7y6c08]{Commanding Presence} by 10ft.</p>",
